  "jp": "\u7247\u938c\u30db\u30be\u5dee\u3057",
  "gloss": "",
  "guidance": "The tenon carries a \u938c hook along one lower edge only. The sill's mortise is a slot open at the sill's end, so the post is slid in along the sill: the hook runs under the sill's lip and the post can no longer be lifted out, while the square face of the hook bears on the lip under uplift. The post's shoulder seats on the sill and its tenon clears the mortise floor.",
